  textComponent: {fileID: 1104961449}
  lines:
  - null
  morning:
  - Existence is but a glitch in the ocean of nothingness.
  afternoon:
  - We are all just pixels yearning for a higher resolution.
  evening:
  - "To be seen is to be trapped, yet to be hidden is to perish\u2026"
  - and what I tell you at dawn will be the ultimate truth.
  superLate:
  - You came for the ultimate truth?
  - At last, I can tell this to you.
  - Ready?
  - You should always remember this.
  - Fish market is the best game ever.
