  - null
  morning:
  - My name is Choco-l-l-l-l-l-ati.
  - Pronounce it correctly, please.
  afternoon:
  - Have you said hi to the pineapple?
  - "Tell me you haven\u2019t eaten it already."
  evening:
  - "You really don\u2019t have anything better to do, do you?"
  superLate:
  - Help the innkeeper has us trapped in here
