  textComponent: {fileID: 1104961449}
  lines:
  - null
  morning:
  - "Hey there! I\u2019m Iyaoi."
  - "I was on my way to Comic-Con, but\u2026 things got complicated because of ICE."
  afternoon:
  - "Drawing Yaoi is brutal\u2026 it barely pays the bills."
  - Still better than Yuri, though. You literally have to starve for that craft.
  evening:
  - Did you know "BL" is more common than "Yaoi" in Asia?
  - "Hmm\u2026 considering my eyes are BL (Big Lense), maybe I\u2019m Asian too."
  superLate:
  - "Yaoi is sensational\u2026"
  - but is anyone obsessed enough to write long-form poetry about it?
  - I highly doubt it.
  textSpeed: 0.03
  theetime: {fileID: 2032897561}
  playerController: {fileID: 212614237}
  myDialBox: {fileID: 1040792365}
  blurFilter: {fileID: 245946042}
  characterUI: {fileID: 2698325}
