--- !u!114 &796460625
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 796460622}
  m_Enabled: 0
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cf315fb13b2d44faca06b9437a6b860a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dial
  textComponent: {fileID: 1104961449}
  lines:
  - null
  morning:
  - "The people here suffer from a chronic condition\u2014"
  - They can only say the same thing for hours.
  - Me? I'm a mermaid.
  - Of course I have it too. I'm a local, after all.
  afternoon:
  - "Honestly, I should\u2019ve auditioned for the Digital Circus\u2026"
  - It is so dull here.
  - The dolphins are cool, I guess.
  evening:
  - If you ever meet the person who created this space, could you ask them something?
  - "Ask them why they just\u2026 made us to be here."
  superLate:
  - "Still wandering around? Don\u2019t you ever get bored?"
  - "If I still have my memories by morning, I\u2019ll tell you something new."
  - "If I start repeating the same old lines\u2026 then I guess I\u2019m still stuck."
  textSpeed: 0.03
  theetime: {fileID: 2032897561}
  playerController: {fileID: 212614237}
  myDialBox: {fileID: 1040792365}
  blurFilter: {fileID: 245946042}
  characterUI: {fileID: 760556761}
